		<title>KCC estimates hurricane Isaias wind and surge insured losses at $3bn</title>
		<link>https://www.artemis.bm/news/kcc-estimates-hurricane-isaias-wind-and-surge-insured-losses-at-3bn/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=kcc-estimates-hurricane-isaias-wind-and-surge-insured-losses-at-3bn</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Steve Evans]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:19:20 +0000</pubDate>
